  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8 - 477 Employees across Appalachian Power Company, Kingsport Power Company, and AEP Service Corp. represented by IBEW Local 978 were provided with a 4.0% wages increase, previously negotiated effective April 1, 2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;45 Employees across Appalachian Power Company, AEP Service Corp., and Kingsport Power Company represented by IBEW Local 934 were provided with a 4.0% wages increase, previously negotiated effective April 1, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;9 - Please refer to the Notes to Financial Statements Pages 122-123&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
